      harmonics on S^3)': 4}, sum 11; in the class (even scalar l, no vector type) {'s0': 1}: one direction
  C1 (control): w = r^-2: residual (3*mu - r**2)/r**3, at r = 2 r_h -1/(8*sqrt(mu)) < 0: not a supersolution, H1's test
